"passages": [
{"id":"gsb:0001-1","title":"一个很高的人","text":"他的锄头太短了。他的门口太低了。他的床太短了。他的自行车太短了。这个人太高了！他做了一个很长的锄柄。他做了一个很高的门框。他做了一张很长的床。他买了一辆很高的自行车。他坐在一把很高的椅子上。他用一把很长的叉子吃饭。他离开他的房子住进一个很大的森林里。他在那里住了很多年。","term":"二上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0001-1.webp","story":{"id":"0001","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"一个很高的人","text":"Cornelius Gulere","illustration":"Catherine Groenewald","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0001_%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%BE%88%E9%AB%98%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0003-1","title":"校服","text":"这条裙子太长了。这件毛衣太大了。这个书包太大了。这条皮带太……这顶帽子太小了。这双袜子太短了。可是这双鞋子是新的。……刚刚合身。","term":"二上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0003-1.webp","story":{"id":"0003","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"校服","text":"Clare Verbeek, Thembani Dladla, Zanele Buthelezi","illustration":"Mlungisi Dlamini, Ingrid Schechter","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0003_%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0004-1","title":"山羊、野狗、和水牛","text":"山羊、野狗、和水牛是很要好的朋友。有一天，他们一起坐出租车。当他们到了目的地的时候，司机叫他们交车费。水牛把她自己的那份交了。野狗没有带零钱，所以他就多给了一点。司机正要找钱给野狗，没想到山羊没有给钱就跑掉了。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0004-1.webp","story":{"id":"0004","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"山羊、野狗、和水牛","text":"Fabian Wakholi","illustration":"Marleen Visser, Ingrid Schechter","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0004_%E5%B1%B1%E7%BE%8A%E3%80%81%E9%87%8E%E7%8B%97%E3%80%81%E5%92%8C%E6%B0%B4%E7%89%9B.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0008-1","title":"你在做什么？","text":"我在唱歌。她在挥手。我在拍手。她在伸手。他在叫喊。我在回答。她在聆听。你在做什么？","term":"二上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0008-1.webp","story":{"id":"0008","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"你在做什么？","text":"Nina Orange","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0008_%E4%BD%A0%E5%9C%A8%E5%81%9A%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0009-1","title":"我的小猫猫在哪儿？","text":"我的小猫猫在哪儿？是不是在床底下？是不是在碗柜上面？是不是在沙发后面？是不是在垃圾桶旁边？是不是在篮子里面？是不是在房子外面？原来在这里！","term":"二下","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0009-1.webp","story":{"id":"0009","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"我的小猫猫在哪儿？","text":"Clare Verbeek, Thembani Dladla, Zanele Buthelezi","illustration":"Bronwen Heath, Ingrid Schechter","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0009_%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8F%E7%8C%AB%E7%8C%AB%E5%9C%A8%E5%93%AA%E5%84%BF.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0030-1","title":"感情","text":"我的心能感受到很多事情。当奶奶跟我们说故事的时候，我感到很高兴。当我跟朋友一起玩的时候，我感到很有趣。当爸爸说他没有钱的时候，我感到很难过。当妈妈拥抱我的时候，我感到亲情。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0030-1.webp","story":{"id":"0030","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"感情","text":"Clare Verbeek, Thembani Dladla, Zanele Buthelezi","illustration":"Kathy Arbuckle, Ingrid Schechter","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0030_%E6%84%9F%E6%83%85.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-1","title":"辛波薇亚（1）","text":"辛波薇亚的妈妈过世的时候，她非常伤心。辛波薇亚的爸爸尽全力照顾孩子。时间久了，他们渐渐开心起来，习惯了没有辛波薇亚妈妈的生活。每天早上，他们坐在一起，谈论着即将到来的一天。每天晚上，他们一起做饭，然后一起洗碗，辛波薇亚的爸爸还帮助她做功课。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-1.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":1,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-2","title":"辛波薇亚（2）","text":"有一天，辛波薇亚的爸爸回家晚了。他一进门就喊道：“亲爱的孩子，你在哪里？”辛波薇亚跑出来迎接爸爸。但她突然停住了，因为她看到爸爸牵着另外一个女人的手。爸爸笑着说：“我的孩子，来，我向你介绍一个很特别的人，她叫阿妮塔。”","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚","阿妮塔"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-2.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":2,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-4","title":"辛波薇亚（3）","text":"爸爸朝辛波薇亚说：“我的孩子，我希望你能接受阿妮塔成为你的母亲。”辛波薇亚的生活变了。她每天早上没有时间和爸爸坐在一起聊天。阿妮塔让辛波薇亚做很多家务，辛波薇亚每天晚上都累极了，根本没有时间做功课。她一吃完晚饭就睡觉了。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚","阿妮塔"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-4.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":3,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-6","title":"辛波薇亚（4）","text":"过了几个月，辛波薇亚的爸爸告诉她们，他要离家一段时间。他说：“我得出差，我相信你们会互相照顾对方的。”辛波薇亚低下头，但她的爸爸没有注意。阿妮塔什么也没说，她也不太高兴。","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚","阿妮塔"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-6.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":4,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-9","title":"辛波薇亚（5）","text":"天黑了，辛波薇亚找到一棵长在小溪旁边的树。她爬上了树，在树枝上搭了一张小床。她唱着歌，渐渐睡着了：“妈妈，妈妈，妈妈，你离开了我，离开了我再也不回来了。爸爸再也不爱我了。妈妈，你什么时候回来，你离开了我……”","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-9.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":5,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-10","title":"辛波薇亚（6）","text":"第二天早上，辛波薇亚又唱起了这首歌。附近的女人到溪水边来洗衣服，她们听到了树上传来的歌声。她们以为这是风穿过树叶的声音，于是就没有在意，继续洗衣服。但其中有个女人仔细地听着这首歌。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-10.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":6,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-11","title":"辛波薇亚（7）","text":"女人抬起头来看着那棵树。当她看到辛波薇亚和那条彩色的毯子时，她吓了一跳：“辛波薇亚，我哥哥的孩子！”其他的女人也停下了手里的活儿，帮助辛波薇亚从树上爬了下来。她的姑姑紧紧地抱着她，尽量安慰她。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-11.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":7,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-12","title":"辛波薇亚（8）","text":"辛波薇亚的姑姑带着她去了自己家。她给辛波薇亚煮了美味的食物，又给她铺了床，让她盖着妈妈的毯子睡觉。那天晚上，辛波薇亚又哭着睡着了。不过这次是欣慰的泪水。她知道她的姑姑会照顾她。辛波薇亚的爸爸回到家里，发现辛波薇亚的房间里空荡荡的。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-12.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":8,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-14","title":"辛波薇亚（9）","text":"辛波薇亚正在和她的表兄弟姐妹玩耍，但她突然看到了远处的爸爸。她害怕爸爸会生气，于是就跑到房子里躲了起来。但是爸爸找到她，对她说：“辛波薇亚，你自己找到了一个完美的妈妈，她爱你，理解你。我为你感到骄傲，我爱你。”","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-14.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":9,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0052-15","title":"辛波薇亚（10）","text":"他们商量后决定辛波薇亚可以和姑姑住在一起，想呆多久就可以呆多久。辛波薇亚的爸爸每天都来看她。有一天，他和阿妮塔一起来了。阿妮塔朝辛波薇亚伸出手，她哭了：“我太抱歉了，小家伙，对不起，我错了，你可以再给我一次机会吗？”辛波薇亚看了看爸爸，看到他忧虑的脸庞。她朝前走了一步，抱住了阿妮塔。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["辛波薇亚","阿妮塔"],"image":"passages/gsb-0052-15.webp","story":{"id":"0052","part":10,"parts":10},"credit":{"title":"辛波薇亚","text":"Rukia Nantale","illustration":"Benjamin Mitchley","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0052_%E8%BE%9B%E6%B3%A2%E8%96%87%E4%BA%9A.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0066-1","title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发（1）","text":"很久很久以前，有三个女孩，她们一起外出找柴火。天很热，她们跳下河游了个泳。她们一边游泳，一边嬉戏，溅出很多水花。突然，她们意识到天已经很晚了，匆匆忙忙赶回村子。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0066-1.webp","story":{"id":"0066","part":1,"parts":7},"credit":{"title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发","text":"Tessa Welch","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0066_%E8%AF%BA%E5%AD%9C%E8%B4%9D%E5%84%BF%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%A0%B9%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0066-2","title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发（2）","text":"当她们快到家的时候，诺孜贝儿摸了摸她的脖子：她把项链落在了外面。于是她请求她的朋友们：“和我一起回去找找吧！”但她的朋友们都说太晚了。诺孜贝儿一个人回到河边，一找到了项链，就赶忙回家，但天太黑了，她迷路了。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["诺孜贝儿"],"image":"passages/gsb-0066-2.webp","story":{"id":"0066","part":2,"parts":7},"credit":{"title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发","text":"Tessa Welch","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0066_%E8%AF%BA%E5%AD%9C%E8%B4%9D%E5%84%BF%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%A0%B9%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0066-3","title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发（3）","text":"她远远地看见有个小木屋，木屋里有一丝光亮。她跑到木屋门口，敲了敲门。诺孜贝儿吃了一惊，开门的是一只会说话的狗：“你来干嘛？”诺孜贝儿说：“我迷路了，我要找个地方睡觉。”狗回答说：“进来吧，不然我就咬你！”然后诺孜贝儿就进了屋。","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["诺孜贝儿"],"image":"passages/gsb-0066-3.webp","story":{"id":"0066","part":3,"parts":7},"credit":{"title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发","text":"Tessa Welch","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0066_%E8%AF%BA%E5%AD%9C%E8%B4%9D%E5%84%BF%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%A0%B9%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0066-4","title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发（4）","text":"狗说：“给我做饭！”诺孜贝儿回答说：“但我从来没有给狗做过饭。”狗说：“快做饭，不然我就咬你。”诺孜贝儿没办法，只能给狗做了一些吃的。狗说：“给我铺床！”诺孜贝儿回答说：“但我从来没有给狗铺过床。”狗说：“快铺床，不然我就咬你。”诺孜贝儿没办法，只能给狗铺了床。","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["诺孜贝儿"],"image":"passages/gsb-0066-4.webp","story":{"id":"0066","part":4,"parts":7},"credit":{"title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发","text":"Tessa Welch","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0066_%E8%AF%BA%E5%AD%9C%E8%B4%9D%E5%84%BF%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%A0%B9%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0066-5","title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发（5）","text":"诺孜贝儿每天都要给狗做饭，打扫屋子，洗衣服。有一天，狗说：“诺孜贝儿，我今天要出门见朋友。在我回来之前，你要打扫好屋子，做好饭，洗好衣服。”","term":"一下","source":"gsb","names":["诺孜贝儿"],"image":"passages/gsb-0066-5.webp","story":{"id":"0066","part":5,"parts":7},"credit":{"title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发","text":"Tessa Welch","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0066_%E8%AF%BA%E5%AD%9C%E8%B4%9D%E5%84%BF%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%A0%B9%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0066-6","title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发（6）","text":"狗一走，诺孜贝儿就从头上拔了三根头发下来。她把一根头发放在床下，一根放在门背后，还有一根放在篱笆上。然后诺孜贝儿用尽全力跑回了家。","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["诺孜贝儿"],"image":"passages/gsb-0066-6.webp","story":{"id":"0066","part":6,"parts":7},"credit":{"title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发","text":"Tessa Welch","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0066_%E8%AF%BA%E5%AD%9C%E8%B4%9D%E5%84%BF%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%A0%B9%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0066-7","title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发（7）","text":"当狗回到家的时候，它开始找诺孜贝儿：“诺孜贝儿，你在哪里？”第一根头发说：“我在这儿，在床底下。”第二根头发说：“我在这儿，在门背后。”第三根头发说：“我在这儿，在篱笆上。”","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["诺孜贝儿"],"image":"passages/gsb-0066-7.webp","story":{"id":"0066","part":7,"parts":7},"credit":{"title":"诺孜贝儿和三根头发","text":"Tessa Welch","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0066_%E8%AF%BA%E5%AD%9C%E8%B4%9D%E5%84%BF%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%89%E6%A0%B9%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0087-1","title":"我喜欢看书","text":"我喜欢看书。我可以念给谁听呢？小妹妹正在熟睡。我可以念给谁听呢？妈妈和奶奶正在忙。我可以念给谁听呢？爸爸和爷爷正在忙。我可以念给谁听呢？我可以念给自己听！","term":"二下","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0087-1.webp","story":{"id":"0087","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"我喜欢看书","text":"Letta Machoga","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0087_%E6%88%91%E5%96%9C%E6%AC%A2%E7%9C%8B%E4%B9%A6.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0089-1","title":"和植物聊天的卡莱（1）","text":"这是卡莱。她今年七岁。在肯尼亚当地方言里，这个名字是“美好事物”的意思。卡莱早上醒来，跟橙子树说：“橙子树啊橙子树，快点长大吧，给我们结好多又大又甜的橙子！”在卡莱走路去上学的路上，她对草地说：“草地啊草地，你一定要长得绿油油的，别干枯了。”","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["卡莱","肯尼亚"],"image":"passages/gsb-0089-1.webp","story":{"id":"0089","part":1,"parts":3},"credit":{"title":"和植物聊天的卡莱","text":"Ursula Nafula","illustration":"Jesse Pietersen","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 4.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0089_%E5%92%8C%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9%E8%81%8A%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%A1%E8%8E%B1.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0089-2","title":"和植物聊天的卡莱（2）","text":"卡莱路过了野花，她对野花说：“野花啊野花，你们尽情地开放吧，这样我可以把你们夹在我的头发里。”在学校，卡莱对操场中间的树说：“小树啊小树，快点长出枝叶吧，这样我们就可以在树荫里读书了。”","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["卡莱"],"image":"passages/gsb-0089-2.webp","story":{"id":"0089","part":2,"parts":3},"credit":{"title":"和植物聊天的卡莱","text":"Ursula Nafula","illustration":"Jesse Pietersen","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 4.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0089_%E5%92%8C%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9%E8%81%8A%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%A1%E8%8E%B1.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0089-3","title":"和植物聊天的卡莱（3）","text":"卡莱还对学校附近的灌木丛说：“灌木啊灌木，你们一定要长得壮壮的，这样坏人就进不了学校了。”当卡莱从学校回到家里，她又去看了看橙子树，问它：“你结橙子了吗？”卡莱叹了一口气：“橙子还是绿色的，我明天再来看看你吧！或许到了明天你就会给我一只又大又甜的橙子了。”","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["卡莱"],"image":"passages/gsb-0089-3.webp","story":{"id":"0089","part":3,"parts":3},"credit":{"title":"和植物聊天的卡莱","text":"Ursula Nafula","illustration":"Jesse Pietersen","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 4.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0089_%E5%92%8C%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9%E8%81%8A%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%A1%E8%8E%B1.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0095-1","title":"赞玛很棒！（1）","text":"我弟弟睡过头了。我很早起床，因为我很棒！是我让阳光透进来。妈妈说：“你是我的晨星”。我自己洗澡。我不需要帮忙。冷冷的水和臭臭的蓝色肥皂对我来说不算大事。妈妈提醒我：“别忘了刷牙。”我回答：“怎么可能，我不会忘记的！”洗好了以后，我跟爷爷和姑妈打个招呼，向他们问好。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0095-1.webp","story":{"id":"0095","part":1,"parts":2},"credit":{"title":"赞玛很棒！","text":"Michael Oguttu","illustration":"Vusi Malindi","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0095_%E8%B5%9E%E7%8E%9B%E5%BE%88%E6%A3%92.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0095-2","title":"赞玛很棒！（2）","text":"然后我自己穿好衣服。“妈，我已经长大了！”我会自己扣好衣扣和鞋子。在上学的路上我跟弟弟说学校的所有消息。上课的时候我认真学习。我每天做这几件好事。可是我最喜欢做的是玩玩玩！","term":"二上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0095-2.webp","story":{"id":"0095","part":2,"parts":2},"credit":{"title":"赞玛很棒！","text":"Michael Oguttu","illustration":"Vusi Malindi","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0095_%E8%B5%9E%E7%8E%9B%E5%BE%88%E6%A3%92.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0111-1","title":"为什么河马没有毛发（1）","text":"有一天，兔子在河边散步。河马也在那儿，一边闲逛，一边找些美味的野草来吃。河马没有看见兔子，她不小心踩到了兔子的脚。兔子尖叫了一声，朝着河马大喊：“该死的河马！没看到你踩到我的脚了吗？”","term":"二下","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0111-1.webp","story":{"id":"0111","part":1,"parts":3},"credit":{"title":"为什么河马没有毛发","text":"Basilio Gimo, David Ker","illustration":"Carol Liddiment","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0111_%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%B2%B3%E9%A9%AC%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%AF%9B%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0111-3","title":"为什么河马没有毛发（2）","text":"兔子找到了火，他对火说：“趁河马从水里出来吃草的时候，朝她放一把火。她竟敢踩我的脚。”火回答说：“没问题，我的朋友！我这就按你说的做。”过了一会儿，河马正在离河岸很远的地方吃草。呼的一声，火突然烧起来了，烧到了河马的身上。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0111-3.webp","story":{"id":"0111","part":2,"parts":3},"credit":{"title":"为什么河马没有毛发","text":"Basilio Gimo, David Ker","illustration":"Carol Liddiment","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0111_%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%B2%B3%E9%A9%AC%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%AF%9B%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0111-4","title":"为什么河马没有毛发（3）","text":"河马尖叫着，赶紧跑向河边，但是她的毛发已经全部烧毁了。河马伤心地说：“我的毛都被火烧掉了！你烧了我的毛！它们全都不见了！我美丽的毛！”兔子终于报了仇，他高兴坏了；直到现在，河马也不敢离河岸太远，因为她害怕又要被火烧。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0111-4.webp","story":{"id":"0111","part":3,"parts":3},"credit":{"title":"为什么河马没有毛发","text":"Basilio Gimo, David Ker","illustration":"Carol Liddiment","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0111_%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%B2%B3%E9%A9%AC%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%AF%9B%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0112-1","title":"我的身体","text":"让我能跑步。让我能跳跃。让我能跳舞。让我能游泳。让我能跳绳。让我能踢球。让我能逃走。可是总不能让我飞！","term":"二下","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0112-1.webp","story":{"id":"0112","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"我的身体","text":"Clare Verbeek, Thembani Dladla, Zanele Buthelezi","illustration":"Mlungisi Dlamini, Ingrid Schechter","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0112_%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E8%BA%AB%E4%BD%93.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0120-1","title":"头发","text":"图丽有一头短发。安娜有一头长发。凯茜的头发最长。萨玛把她的头发编成辫子。巴巴留着胡子。萨内蕾梳了头发。塔波剪了头发。腾巴剃光了头发。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["图丽","安娜","凯茜","萨玛","巴巴","萨内蕾","塔波","腾巴"],"image":"passages/gsb-0120-1.webp","story":{"id":"0120","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"头发","text":"Clare Verbeek, Thembani Dladla, Zanele Buthelezi","illustration":"Bronwen Heath, Ingrid Schechter","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0120_%E5%A4%B4%E5%8F%91.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0231-1","title":"气象书","text":"天气很干燥。太阳很热。吹大风。天气多云。天气冷。下雨。打雷。我看到彩虹。","term":"二下","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0231-1.webp","story":{"id":"0231","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"气象书","text":"Clare Verbeek, Thembani Dladla, Zanele Buthelezi","illustration":"Sandra McDougall, Ingrid Schechter","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0231_%E6%B0%94%E8%B1%A1%E4%B9%A6.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0234-1","title":"球星安迪斯瓦（1）","text":"安迪斯瓦喜欢看男孩子们踢足球，她多么希望自己也能加入他们啊！她跑去问教练，自己能不能跟男孩们一起训练。教练两手叉着腰，摇了摇头说：“在这个学校，只有男孩们能踢足球。”","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["安迪斯瓦"],"image":"passages/gsb-0234-1.webp","story":{"id":"0234","part":1,"parts":2},"credit":{"title":"球星安迪斯瓦","text":"Eden Daniels","illustration":"Eden Daniels","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0234_%E7%90%83%E6%98%9F%E5%AE%89%E8%BF%AA%E6%96%AF%E7%93%A6.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0234-2","title":"球星安迪斯瓦（2）","text":"男孩们让安迪斯瓦去玩投球。他们觉得，女孩们应该玩儿投球，足球是男孩们的运动。安迪斯瓦很沮丧。第二天，学校里要举行一场盛大的足球比赛。教练有点儿担心，因为队里最棒的球员生病了，没法上场。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["安迪斯瓦"],"image":"passages/gsb-0234-2.webp","story":{"id":"0234","part":2,"parts":2},"credit":{"title":"球星安迪斯瓦","text":"Eden Daniels","illustration":"Eden Daniels","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0234_%E7%90%83%E6%98%9F%E5%AE%89%E8%BF%AA%E6%96%AF%E7%93%A6.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0271-1","title":"两个","text":"两只手用来拿东西。两只脚用来踢踢球。两只眼睛用来看看。两只小耳朵用来听听。还有两只小手用来抱抱！","term":"一下","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0271-1.webp","story":{"id":"0271","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"两个","text":"Carole Bloch","illustration":"Richard MacIntosh","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY-NC 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0271_%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0302-1","title":"火","text":"你看，火！火烧。火煮。火可以用来取暖。火可以带来光亮。你看，火！火很神奇。也很有力量。","term":"三上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0302-1.webp","story":{"id":"0302","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"火","text":"Deborah Namugosa, Beatrice Nabune, Alison Tukei, Rose Sabano","illustration":"Rob Owen","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0302_%E7%81%AB.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0315-1","title":"萨可满的歌声（1）","text":"萨可满和他的父母，还有四岁的妹妹住在一起，他们住在一个富人的土地上，他们的茅草屋在一排大树的后面。萨可满三岁的时候，生了一场大病，从此，萨可满就看不见了，其实萨可满是一个非常有天赋的孩子。","term":"二上","source":"gsb","names":["萨可满"],"image":"passages/gsb-0315-1.webp","story":{"id":"0315","part":1,"parts":4},"credit":{"title":"萨可满的歌声","text":"Ursula Nafula","illustration":"Peris Wachuka","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 4.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0315_%E8%90%A8%E5%8F%AF%E6%BB%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%8C%E5%A3%B0.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0315-2","title":"萨可满的歌声（2）","text":"萨可满今年六岁，他会做很多同龄的男孩不会做的事情，比如，萨可满能和村里的老人坐在一起讨论重要的事情。萨可满的父母在富人的家里工作。他们每天早出晚归，萨可满就和妹妹呆在家里。萨可满很喜欢唱歌。有一天，他的妈妈问他：“萨可满，你从哪儿学了这些歌？”","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["萨可满"],"image":"passages/gsb-0315-2.webp","story":{"id":"0315","part":2,"parts":4},"credit":{"title":"萨可满的歌声","text":"Ursula Nafula","illustration":"Peris Wachuka","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 4.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0315_%E8%90%A8%E5%8F%AF%E6%BB%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%8C%E5%A3%B0.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0315-3","title":"萨可满的歌声（3）","text":"萨可满回答说：“它们就这样出现在我的脑海里，我想到了这些歌，就把它们唱了出来。”萨可满很喜欢给他的妹妹唱歌，特别是她肚子饿的时候。妹妹听着萨可满唱他最喜欢的歌，跟着甜美的歌声摆动起来。萨可满的妹妹经常求他：“再唱一次吧！”萨可满唱了一遍又一遍。","term":"二下","source":"gsb","names":["萨可满"],"image":"passages/gsb-0315-3.webp","story":{"id":"0315","part":3,"parts":4},"credit":{"title":"萨可满的歌声","text":"Ursula Nafula","illustration":"Peris Wachuka","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 4.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0315_%E8%90%A8%E5%8F%AF%E6%BB%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%8C%E5%A3%B0.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0315-6","title":"萨可满的歌声（4）","text":"第二天，萨可满让他的妹妹带他去富人的房子。他站在一扇大窗户的下面，开始唱他最喜欢的歌。慢慢的，富人的脑袋从窗户里伸出来。工人们停下了工作。他们仔细地听着萨可满唱歌。有一个人说：“从来没有人能安慰老板，这个看不见的男孩觉得他可以做到吗？”","term":"三上","source":"gsb","names":["萨可满"],"image":"passages/gsb-0315-6.webp","story":{"id":"0315","part":4,"parts":4},"credit":{"title":"萨可满的歌声","text":"Ursula Nafula","illustration":"Peris Wachuka","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 4.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0315_%E8%90%A8%E5%8F%AF%E6%BB%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%8C%E5%A3%B0.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0327-1","title":"数数动物","text":"一头大象去喝水。两只长颈鹿去喝水。这里有三头水牛和四只鸟，全部都要去喝水。五只高角羚和六只疣猪走去喝水。七匹斑马跑去喝水。水中有八只青蛙，也有九条鱼。一头狮子吼叫着。他也想喝水。谁怕狮子了？一头大象和狮子一起喝水。","term":"二上","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0327-1.webp","story":{"id":"0327","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"数数动物","text":"Zanele Buthelezi, Thembani Dladla, Clare Verbeek","illustration":"Rob Owen","translation":"dohliam","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":true,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0327_%E6%95%B0%E6%95%B0%E5%8A%A8%E7%89%A9.md"}},
{"id":"gsb:0337-1","title":"蜡做的孩子","text":"很久很久以前，有一家人快乐地生活在一起。孩子们从来不打架，还帮助爸爸妈妈做家务，干农活。但是他们不能靠近火焰。没办法，他们只能在晚上工作，因为他们都是用蜡做的！但是其中一个男孩非常想出门，他想走到太阳底下看看。","term":"二下","source":"gsb","image":"passages/gsb-0337-1.webp","story":{"id":"0337","part":1,"parts":1},"credit":{"title":"蜡做的孩子","text":"Southern African Folktale","illustration":"Wiehan de Jager","translation":"Vicky Liu","licence":"CC BY 3.0","adapted":false,"source":"https://github.com/global-asp/sbc-source/blob/be28dab/zh/0337_%E8%9C%A1%E5%81%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%A9%E5%AD%90.md"}}
]
}
